                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              We recommend sending your request at least 2 weeks ahead to secure your dates, as Chef Nino takes a limited number of bookings. Last-minute requests can often be accommodated depending on availability. Sending a request costs nothing — if your dates can't be served, Chef Nino simply lets you know and no payment is ever taken.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>What if I have dietary restrictions?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              Chef Nino is experienced in accommodating all dietary needs including vegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, kosher, halal, and specific allergies. Simply specify your requirements during booking.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>Do I need to provide any kitchen equipment?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              Chef Nino works with your existing kitchen equipment. We recommend having basic cooking utensils, pots, pans, and appliances. If anything specific is needed, Chef Nino will discuss it with you before service begins.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>What time will the chef arrive?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              Service times are customised to your schedule. Chef Nino will coordinate with you to determine the best times for meal preparation, based on when you prefer to eat — breakfast, lunch, dinner, or whatever suits you.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>Can I cancel or reschedule?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              Of course. Since no payment is taken on the site, just let Chef Nino know as early as you can and he'll reschedule your dates, subject to availability, at no charge. If you've already settled a confirmed booking via the secure payment link, any cancellation and refund is handled personally by Chef Nino, case by case — there's no automated online refund. See our <a href="/terms" class="text-gold-600 underline">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for full details.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>Are groceries included in the price?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              No — groceries and ingredients are billed separately, at cost, on top of the price Chef Nino quotes you. Chef Nino handles the shopping and sources premium ingredients, and you simply cover what they cost.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>How many guests can you cater for, and where do you serve?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">
              There is no fixed package and no headcount cap — Chef Nino tailors the proposal to your event, so the price reflects your guest count and the meals you choose. Service is provided across Lombardy. For service anywhere outside Lombardy, travel and accommodation are arranged per destination (or you can simply provide a room for the chef). You'll hear back within 24 hours.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer hover:shadow-soft transition-shadow border border-gray-200">
            <summary class="flex justify-between items-center gap-3 pr-2 font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-900 list-none">
              <span>How does the booking confirmation process work?</span>
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-gold-600 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 text-sm mb-3">
              You send your request through the form — with no payment taken on the site. Chef Nino then reviews it personally to confirm availability for your chosen dates and location, and gets back to you within 24 hours.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 text-sm mt-3">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mr-2 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>Chef Nino checks availability for your dates and confirms he can serve your location</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mr-2 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>Once the menu is planned, he sends a bespoke proposal and a secure payment link, handled personally</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-600 mr-2 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <span>Your booking is confirmed only once payment is settled — nothing is charged automatically by the site</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reviews" class="py-16 md:py-32 bg-gray-50">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4 md:mb-6">
            Guest Reviews
          </h2>
          <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Real guests, real evenings — verified on independent platforms.
          </p>
        </div>

        {allReviews.length > 0 && (
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto mb-12 md:mb-16">
            {allReviews.map((review) => (
              <div class="bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-soft hover:shadow-soft-lg transition-all duration-300 border border-gray-100 flex flex-col">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 text-xl mb-4" role="img" aria-label={`Rated ${review.rating} out of 5 stars`}>
                  {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((star) => (
                    <span class={star <= Math.round(review.rating) ? 'text-gold-500' : 'text-gray-300'} aria-hidden="true">★</span>
                  ))}
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">
                  “{review.quote}”
                </p>
                {review.video && (
                  <video controls preload="metadata" class="w-full max-h-52 rounded-xl bg-black mb-4" src={review.video}></video>
                )}
                {review.photos.length > 0 && (
                  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                    {review.photos.map((photo) => (
                      <img src={photo} alt={`Photo shared by ${review.author}`} loading="lazy" class="w-16 h-16 rounded-lg object-cover border border-gray-100" />
                    ))}
                  </div>
                )}
                <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-100">
                  <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">
                    {[review.author, review.occasion, review.location].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}
                  </p>
                  {review.source === 'site' ? (
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium mt-1 inline-block">Guest review</span>
                  ) : review.url ? (
                    <a href={review.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-xs text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 font-medium mt-1 inline-block">
                      via {platforms[review.source].name} ↗
                    </a>
                  ) : (
                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium mt-1 inline-block">
                      via {platforms[review.source].name}
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base mb-6">
            Have you dined with Chef Nino? Share your experience on an independent review platform.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
            <a
              href={platforms.trustpilot.writeReviewUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800 px-8 py-3.5 text-base"
            >
              Review us on Trustpilot ↗
            </a>
            <button
              id="rv-toggle"
              type="button"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 border-2 border-gray-900 text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base"
            >
              Share your experience
            </button>
            {platforms.google.writeReviewUrl && (
              <a
                href={platforms.google.writeReviewUrl}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 border-2 border-gray-900 text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base"
              >
                Review us on Google ↗
              </a>
            )}
          </div>
          {(platforms.trustpilot.profileUrl || platforms.google.profileUrl) && (
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-6">
              {platforms.trustpilot.profileUrl && (
                <a href={platforms.trustpilot.profileUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 underline">All our Trustpilot reviews ↗</a>
              )}
              {platforms.trustpilot.profileUrl && platforms.google.profileUrl && <span class="mx-2">·</span>}
              {platforms.google.profileUrl && (
                <a href={platforms.google.profileUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 underline">All our Google reviews ↗</a>
              )}
            </p>
          )}
        </div>

        <!-- Inline "write a review" form. Media go DIRECTLY to Supabase Storage
             via short-lived signed upload URLs (Vercel serverless caps request
             bodies at ~4.5 MB, so files never touch our API), then the text +
             storage paths are submitted as JSON. The review stays hidden until
             the owner approves it in /owner#reviews. -->
        <div id="rv-form-wrap" class="hidden mt-10 md:mt-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-left">
          <form id="rv-form" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-soft border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8" novalidate>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Share your experience</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">Reviews are checked by our team before appearing on the site.</p>

            <div class="mb-6">
              <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-2">Your rating *</span>
              <div id="rv-stars" class="flex gap-1">
                {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((star) => (
                  <button type="button" class="rv-star text-3xl leading-none text-gray-300 hover:scale-110 transition-transform" data-star={star} aria-label={`${star} star${star > 1 ? 's' : ''}`}>★</button>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <label for="rv-name" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1">Your name *</label>
                <input id="rv-name" type="text" maxlength="120" required class="w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-gray-300 px-0 py-2.5 text-base focus:border-gold-500 focus:ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-400" placeholder="First name" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="rv-occasion" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1">Occasion <span class="normal-case text-gray-400">(optional)</span></label>
                <input id="rv-occasion" type="text" maxlength="120" class="w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-gray-300 px-0 py-2.5 text-base focus:border-gold-500 focus:ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-400" placeholder="e.g. Anniversary dinner" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6">
              <label for="rv-email" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1">Email <span class="normal-case text-gray-400">(optional — never published)</span></label>
              <input id="rv-email" type="email" maxlength="200" class="w-full bg-transparent border-0 border-b border-gray-300 px-0 py-2.5 text-base focus:border-gold-500 focus:ring-0 placeholder:text-gray-400" placeholder="you@example.com" />
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6">
              <label for="rv-text" class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-1">Your review *</label>
              <textarea id="rv-text" rows="4" maxlength="4000" required class="w-full rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 px-4 py-3 text-base focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-gold-500 focus:border-gold-500 placeholder:text-gray-400" placeholder="How was your evening with Chef Nino?"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div>
                <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-2">Photos <span class="normal-case text-gray-400">(up to 3, max 8 MB each)</span></span>
                <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-gold-500 hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15.75l5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5l1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l2.909 2.909M3.75 21h16.5A1.5 1.5 0 0021.75 19.5V4.5A1.5 1.5 0 0020.25 3H3.75A1.5 1.5 0 002.25 4.5v15A1.5 1.5 0 003.75 21z"/></svg>
                  Add photos
                  <input id="rv-photos" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/heic,image/heif" multiple class="hidden" />
                </label>
                <div id="rv-photo-previews" class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 mb-2">Video <span class="normal-case text-gray-400">(1, up to ~60s, max 100 MB)</span></span>
                <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer rounded-lg border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 hover:border-gold-500 hover:text-gold-600 transition-colors">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 10.5l4.72-4.72a.75.75 0 011.28.53v11.38a.75.75 0 01-1.28.53l-4.72-4.72M4.5 18.75h9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-9A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 5.25h-9A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 7.5v9a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z"/></svg>
                  Add a video
                  <input id="rv-video" type="file" accept="video/mp4,video/quicktime,video/webm" class="hidden" />
                </label>
                <p id="rv-video-name" class="mt-3 text-xs text-gray-500 break-all"></p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Honeypot: humans never see or fill this. -->
            <input type="text" name="company_website" id="rv-hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="hidden" aria-hidden="true" />

            <button id="rv-submit" type="submit" class="mt-8 w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800 px-8 py-3.5 text-base disabled:opacity-50">
              <span id="rv-submit-label">Submit review</span>
            </button>
            <p id="rv-status" class="mt-3 text-sm text-red-600 hidden"></p>
          </form>
          <div id="rv-success" class="hidden bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-soft border border-gray-100 p-8 text-center">
            <div class="text-gold-500 text-3xl mb-3" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Thank you!</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600">Your review will appear once approved.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 md:py-32 bg-gray-900 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center relative z-10">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold mb-6">
          Ready to Get Started?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Book your private chef today and bring restaurant-quality dining to your home.
        </p>
        <Button href="/richiesta" variant="secondary" size="lg">
          Book Your Chef
        </Button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
  // ---- Guest review form: toggle, stars, media, direct-to-Storage upload ----
  const $rv = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id);

  const rvToggle = $rv('rv-toggle');
  const rvWrap = $rv('rv-form-wrap');
  rvToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!rvWrap) return;
    rvWrap.classList.toggle('hidden');
    if (!rvWrap.classList.contains('hidden')) {
      rvWrap.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });
    }
  });

  // Star selector (hover previews, click locks the rating).
  let rvRating = 0;
  const rvStars = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.rv-star'));
  function paintStars(n: number) {
    rvStars.forEach((s) => {
      const v = Number(s.dataset.star);
      s.classList.toggle('text-gold-500', v <= n);
      s.classList.toggle('text-gray-300', v > n);
    });
  }
  rvStars.forEach((s) => {
    s.addEventListener('click', () => { rvRating = Number(s.dataset.star) || 0; paintStars(rvRating); });
    s.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => paintStars(Number(s.dataset.star) || 0));
    s.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => paintStars(rvRating));
  });

  const RV_MAX_PHOTOS = 3;
  const RV_MAX_PHOTO_BYTES = 8 * 1024 * 1024;
  const RV_MAX_VIDEO_BYTES = 100 * 1024 * 1024;
  const RV_PHOTO_TYPES = ['image/jpeg', 'image/png', 'image/webp', 'image/heic', 'image/heif'];
  const RV_VIDEO_TYPES = ['video/mp4', 'video/quicktime', 'video/webm'];
  let rvPhotoFiles: File[] = [];
  let rvVideoFile: File | null = null;

  const rvStatusEl = $rv('rv-status');
  function rvStatus(msg: string, ok = false) {
    if (!rvStatusEl) return;
    rvStatusEl.textContent = msg;
    rvStatusEl.className = 'mt-3 text-sm ' + (ok ? 'text-green-700' : 'text-red-600');
  }
  function rvClearStatus() { rvStatusEl?.classList.add('hidden'); }

  // Photos: cap 3, 8 MB each, image types only; small previews.
  const rvPhotosInput = $rv('rv-photos') as HTMLInputElement | null;
  const rvPreviews = $rv('rv-photo-previews');
  rvPhotosInput?.addEventListener('change', () => {
    rvClearStatus();
    const picked = Array.from(rvPhotosInput.files || []);
    const valid: File[] = [];
    for (const f of picked) {
      if (!RV_PHOTO_TYPES.includes(f.type)) { rvStatus('Photos must be JPEG, PNG, WEBP or HEIC.'); continue; }
      if (f.size > RV_MAX_PHOTO_BYTES) { rvStatus('"' + f.name + '" is over 8 MB — please pick a smaller photo.'); continue; }
      valid.push(f);
    }
    if (valid.length > RV_MAX_PHOTOS) rvStatus('Only the first ' + RV_MAX_PHOTOS + ' photos are attached.');
    rvPhotoFiles = valid.slice(0, RV_MAX_PHOTOS);
    if (rvPreviews) {
      rvPreviews.innerHTML = '';
      rvPhotoFiles.forEach((f) => {
        const img = document.createElement('img');
        img.src = URL.createObjectURL(f);
        img.alt = f.name;
        img.className = 'w-16 h-16 rounded-lg object-cover border border-gray-200';
        rvPreviews.appendChild(img);
      });
    }
  });

  // Video: one file, 100 MB hard cap (≤60s recommended).
  const rvVideoInput = $rv('rv-video') as HTMLInputElement | null;
  const rvVideoName = $rv('rv-video-name');
  rvVideoInput?.addEventListener('change', () => {
    rvClearStatus();
    const f = (rvVideoInput.files || [])[0] || null;
    rvVideoFile = null;
    if (rvVideoName) rvVideoName.textContent = '';
    if (!f) return;
    if (!RV_VIDEO_TYPES.includes(f.type)) { rvStatus('The video must be MP4, MOV or WEBM.'); rvVideoInput.value = ''; return; }
    if (f.size > RV_MAX_VIDEO_BYTES) { rvStatus('The video is too large (max 100 MB).'); rvVideoInput.value = ''; return; }
    rvVideoFile = f;
    if (rvVideoName) rvVideoName.textContent = f.name + ' (' + (f.size / (1024 * 1024)).toFixed(1) + ' MB)';
  });

  // Submit: 1) ask the server for signed upload URLs, 2) PUT files DIRECTLY to
  // Supabase Storage (Vercel serverless caps request bodies at ~4.5 MB, so
  // files must never go through our API), 3) submit the review as JSON.
  const rvForm = $rv('rv-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const rvSubmitBtn = $rv('rv-submit') as HTMLButtonElement | null;
  const rvSubmitLabel = $rv('rv-submit-label');
  rvForm?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    rvClearStatus();
    const name = ($rv('rv-name') as HTMLInputElement | null)?.value.trim() || '';
    const email = ($rv('rv-email') as HTMLInputElement | null)?.value.trim() || '';
    const occasion = ($rv('rv-occasion') as HTMLInputElement | null)?.value.trim() || '';
    const text = ($rv('rv-text') as HTMLTextAreaElement | null)?.value.trim() || '';
    const hp = ($rv('rv-hp') as HTMLInputElement | null)?.value || '';
    if (!rvRating) return rvStatus('Please select a star rating.');
    if (!name) return rvStatus('Please add your name.');
    if (!text) return rvStatus('Please write a few words about your experience.');

    if (rvSubmitBtn) rvSubmitBtn.disabled = true;
    if (rvSubmitLabel) rvSubmitLabel.textContent = 'Sending…';
    try {
      const files = [
        ...rvPhotoFiles.map((file) => ({ kind: 'photo' as const, file })),
        ...(rvVideoFile ? [{ kind: 'video' as const, file: rvVideoFile }] : []),
      ];
      const photoPaths: string[] = [];
      let videoPath: string | null = null;
      if (files.length) {
        if (rvSubmitLabel) rvSubmitLabel.textContent = 'Uploading media…';
        const urlRes = await fetch('/api/reviews/upload-url', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            company_website: hp,
            files: files.map((f) => ({ kind: f.kind, content_type: f.file.type, size: f.file.size })),
          }),
        });
        const urlData = await urlRes.json().catch(() => ({}));
        if (!urlRes.ok || !Array.isArray(urlData.uploads) || urlData.uploads.length !== files.length) {
          throw new Error(urlData?.error || 'Could not prepare the upload.');
        }
        for (let i = 0; i < files.length; i++) {
          const up = urlData.uploads[i]; // same order as requested
          const put = await fetch(up.url, {
            method: 'PUT',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': files[i].file.type, 'x-upsert': 'false' },
            body: files[i].file,
          });
          if (!put.ok) throw new Error('A file upload failed — please try again.');
          if (files[i].kind === 'video') videoPath = up.path;
          else photoPaths.push(up.path);
        }
      }

      if (rvSubmitLabel) rvSubmitLabel.textContent = 'Sending…';
      const res = await fetch('/api/reviews/submit', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({
          company_website: hp,
          name,
          email,
          occasion,
          rating: rvRating,
          review_text: text,
          photo_paths: photoPaths,
          video_path: videoPath,
        }),
      });
      const data = await res.json().catch(() => ({}));
      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(data?.error || 'Could not submit your review.');
      rvForm.classList.add('hidden');
      $rv('rv-success')?.classList.remove('hidden');
    } catch (err) {
      rvStatus(err instanceof Error ? err.message : 'Something went wrong — please try again.');
      if (rvSubmitBtn) rvSubmitBtn.disabled = false;
      if (rvSubmitLabel) rvSubmitLabel.textContent = 'Submit review';
    }
  });
</script>
